                }
                DESCRIPTION "The lab is located some way by itself, in a charming and peaceful location, such as in a beautiful vale or garden. +2 Health, +1 Aesthetics; 1 point on a Specialization in Cr, An, Aq, He, or Te, depending upon terrain type."
