                    ^"Group" STRING "Structure" FIXED
                    ^"Repeatable" BOOLEAN false
                    ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
                }
                DESCRIPTION "The lab's chamber is a difficult shape, for example, it is long and thin, or is partitioned in two. –2 Safety, –1 Aesthetics."
