                    ^"Group" STRING "Supernatural" FIXED
                    ^"Repeatable" BOOLEAN false
                    ^"Source" STRING "Core Rules"
                }
                DESCRIPTION "A small group of semiintelligent creatures helps out in the lab. +1 General Quality, +1 Upkeep, +1 Safety, +1 Aesthetics; 1 point on Rego or another appropriate Art specialization."
